 RAM"],["Graphics","Vulkan support with 3 GB VRAM (Nvidia GeForce 900 series / AMD Radeon RX 400 series)"],["Storage","8 GB available space"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Once a peaceful world of interest to archaeologists, Gladius Prime changes when ancient relics unearthed by colonists awaken something terrible. This 4X strategy title is played in turns: you lead one of four Warhammer 40,000 factions, Orks, Necrons, Space Marines or the Astra Militarum, as they explore, expand, research and fight over the planet's resources. Each faction has its own playstyle.\n\nOpponents can be AI or human, and the game supports co-op over the internet, a local network or split screen, alongside competitive online play. A single-player mode is available too. It suits strategy fans who like the 4X structure and want a Warhammer 40,000 setting."}}